Package: efd-unpacker
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libstdc++6 (>= 4.8.1), libgl1, libegl1, libglib2.0-0, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1
Maintainer: Ingvar Consulting LLC <i@ingvar.pro>
Homepage: https://github.com/IngvarConsulting/efd_unpacker
Description: unpacker for 1C:Enterprise EFD distribution files
 EFD Unpacker extracts the contents of .efd supply files used by the
 1C:Enterprise platform to distribute configuration templates.
 .
 Features:
  * Unpack EFD files to local directories
  * Support for both GUI and command line interfaces
  * Automatic file association with .efd files
  * Cross-platform compatibility
  * Localization support (English and Russian)
